### Get all libros
GET http://localhost:3000/libros
Accept: application/json

### Get libro by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/libros/c6cbac7e-13eb-486d-851f-cd6b77ff987f
Accept: application/json

### Delete libro by ID
DELETE http://localhost:3000/libros/e32f77a4-cc2d-4022-8b92-5f3fd56cf513
Accept: application/json

### Create a new libro
POST http://localhost:3000/libros
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "jaja",
  "autor": "123",
  "anio": 1995
}

### Update a libro by ID
PUT http://localhost:3000/libros/1ff574a0-28a0-40c6-972b-43a2c65a4c99
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "Honda",
  "autor": "CB500F",
  "anio": 6500,
  "id":"1ff574a0-28a0-40c6-972b-43a2c65a4c99"
}
